      "name": "Flames",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>You create a 5-foot-diameter sphere of fire in an unoccupied space on the ground within range. It lasts for the duration. Any creature that ends its turn within 5 feet of the sphere makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 2d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
